+ * slots. Fifteen of the eighteen 4-4-2/Sweep forwards in the corpus match the
+ * AMIGA rows and none match these, while every discriminating byte in slots 0-7
+ * matches DOS. So this is faithfully what the DOS binary holds, and it is NOT
